summary: A long session that carried the Classroom from "engine shipped, never run" to a full, taught, visible system. Ran the first real gated term (3 externals all REFINED), fixed a framework bug found live, built the entire 4-tab Academy GUI, authored PARA 901 via the team, and delivered the nevr.land registry impact brief. Both sequenced-after-MVP strategic tasks closed. Everything pushed to origin/warpline-surfaces alongside another agent's live Warpline write-path work with zero crossover.
